{Hydromel Potion}

With this potion equipped, you gain +2 Attack and +2 Defense.

One dose is used after each battle in which the flask is equipped. Keep it in your backpack to save doses. The empty flask vanishes. Return to its fountain to obtain a full flask of three doses.

{Venus's Blessing}

With this potion equipped, you have maximum Morale and Luck.

One dose is used after each battle in which the flask is equipped. Keep it in your backpack to save doses. The empty flask vanishes. Return to its fountain to obtain a full flask of three doses.

{Berserker Potion}

With this potion equipped, you gain +10 Attack and maximum Luck... but you will not be able to cast spells in combat.

One dose is used after each battle in which the flask is equipped. Keep it in your backpack to save doses. The empty flask vanishes. Return to its fountain to obtain a full flask of three doses.
